      "writtenOn": "2024-10-09T12:40:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Qualcomm requires 512 bytes as additional space in the task_struct. So, I doubled that number and made that the maximum additional space up to which a vendor can request. 1024 is the absolute maximum which I just added as a safety check, vendors can request far lesser than that via cmdline.",
      "parentUuid": "7becc180_80ecd17b",
